{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蓮藕糯米肉丸是一道老少咸宜、既傳統又特別的家常菜式。在《在家宴客60道菜》節目中，肥媽特別示範了這道「糯米蒸肉丸」的做法。這道菜外層裹著帶有嚼勁的糯米，內裡則是口感爽脆的蓮藕，再配搭完美比例的鮮嫩豬肉，一口咬下鮮甜多汁，絕對是宴客或家常加餸的必學之選！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d1ac0835-d5d7-4305-bab1-0d92fd3fd239.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026fFcEwFPsIS1787907408.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d1ac0835-d5d7-4305-bab1-0d92fd3fd239.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b931ed4f-c28e-4677-9cdc-0ced5c39fff7.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026jijKxD9nPl1787907408.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b931ed4f-c28e-4677-9cdc-0ced5c39fff7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">準備食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">裝飾點綴： 炸小棠菜葉絲、杞子</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">烹調步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7b94a705-80a0-468d-bb20-fd76c5acd077.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026IHJqjQnuwn1787907408.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7b94a705-80a0-468d-bb20-fd76c5acd077.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">零失敗入廚貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T10:20:54.843194+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}